{
  "name": "tour",
  "title": "為整個工作流程騰出空間。",
  "summary": "設計、撰寫、審閱、借用、自動化，再配合更大的桌面。",
  "requires": {
    "displays": 1
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "kind": "clearOverlay"
    },
    {
      "kind": "pointer",
      "display": 0,
      "x": 0.5,
      "y": 0.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Write",
      "profile": "Laptop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Editor",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design",
      "profile": "Laptop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cli",
      "args": [
        "layout",
        "balance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1800
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 設計"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "每個工作空間分別保存一項工作所需的 App 與視窗排列。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "將一個視窗放大至整個工作空間。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "theme",
      "value": "sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.forest"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "取消放大後，恢復原本的視窗排列。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Docs",
      "identifier": "docs.content"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 撰寫"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "切換工作空間，一次顯示下一項工作需要的 App。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Write"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Editor",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.headline"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "cmd - a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Editor",
      "text": "讓工作更從容。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectValue",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.headline",
      "value": "讓工作更從容。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.save"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "headline",
      "value": "讓工作更從容。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "回到 Design，先前使用的 App 仍在原本的位置。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - =",
      "repeats": 2
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.export"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "exported",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 審閱"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用工作空間快速鍵一次切換整組 App。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Review"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Review",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.check"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "checksPassed",
      "value": "3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.comment"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Review",
      "text": "準備好了，預覽也已輸出。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.approve"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "approved",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "返回時，視窗的位置與大小會恢復。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 借用"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用借用功能，將另一個工作空間顯示在目前的工作空間旁。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Notes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Notes",
      "identifier": "notes.task.1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Notes",
      "identifier": "notes.newTask"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Notes",
      "text": "準備發布公告。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "lastTask",
      "value": "準備發布公告。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - /"
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 置頂"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "設為保持最上層的視窗，會持續顯示在其他 App 上方。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "launch",
      "apps": [
        "Monitor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Monitor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Monitor",
      "identifier": "monitor.mode"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dragWindow",
      "app": "Monitor",
      "target": "Docs",
      "x": 0.3,
      "y": 0.7
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 自動化"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用 CLI 將多個工作空間操作組合成指令稿。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Build"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Terminal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Terminal",
      "identifier": "terminal.command"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Terminal",
      "text": "focus-session",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectCommand",
      "text": "focus-session",
      "code": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs",
        "Notes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectHook",
      "field": "workspace",
      "value": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - /"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 配合環境"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "連接顯示器後，自動切換至符合條件的設定組合。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveWindow",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveWindow",
      "app": "Docs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "virtualDisplay",
      "connected": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitProfile",
      "profile": "Desk",
      "timeoutMs": 12000
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectHook",
      "field": "profile",
      "value": "Desk"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "中斷顯示器連接後，恢復筆電的設定組合與排列。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "virtualDisplay",
      "connected": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitProfile",
      "profile": "Laptop",
      "timeoutMs": 12000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertWindow",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertWindow",
      "app": "Docs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "TATAMI"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "工具與工作位置，都為你保留。 | 支援 BSP 視窗並排的 macOS 工作空間管理工具。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2600
    }
  ],
  "openingApps": [
    "Canvas",
    "Docs"
  ]
}
